"The mkdocs.yml has no nav section. The files were imported without "
"structure; each page takes its first heading as its title, or its file name "
"when it has none."
msgstr ""
"Die mkdocs.yml enthält keinen nav-Abschnitt. Die Dateien wurden ohne "
